# Tauren Starter (1-13): Camp Narache and Red Cloud Mesa, Bloodhoof Village and the plains of
# Mulgore (the wells, the Palemane gnolls, the Bael'dun dwarves, the Venture Co. mine, the Galak
# centaurs, Red Rocks, the Windfury harpies), Thunder Bluff, then the road through Camp Taurajo to
# the Crossroads, the wind rider errand back to Thunder Bluff, and Durotar and Orgrimmar on the
# way to the zeppelin for Undercity, for a Tauren duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/tauren_starter_1_13.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites, race and class masks, drops and the
# places of mobs and objects from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games
# (Mulgore, area 215; Thunder Bluff; Durotar; the quest pages of the doubtful ones); Zygor's route
# as a check (there is no RestedXP route below level 21). Wowhead not consulted.
# The quest list is section 2 of addon/guides/horde_1_40_allocation.md.
# Data notes: the three well-cleansing objectives and Perith's escort have no place in the builder's
#   data, so their steps give it (Winterhoof 51.8,68.4; Thunderhorn 44.2,51.1; Wildmane 42.7,25.0,
#   north of Thunder Bluff; the escort ends at 37.2,64.6). The Brazier of the Dormant Flame and its
#   fire spirit are on Telf Joolam's hill in Durotar (outof.games).
#
# Starts at Camp Narache, where Tauren begin.
# Added from the Undead Starter's list (each starter is its own chain): Rezlak's Winds in the Desert
#   (834) and Securing the Lines (835) in Durotar, beside A Simmering Storm (97281).
# Dropped:
# - Welcome to Azeroth (95350, Alaana Stormwalker): for Windshaper Skyborne only, after their
#   starter's last quest (95349).
# Race-only quests: none to tell apart (this guide is for Tauren only); the class quests are kept
#   for their class by the builder.
# The auction house: Light Leather for Gathering Leather (768) is offered at Thunder Bluff's
#   auction house; skinners can skin it instead.
#
# The route: Camp Narache (1-6); Bloodhoof Village and five loops around it (the west plains and
# Palemane Rock; the Winterhoof well, the southern gnolls and harpies and Malah Longwind; the
# northern plains and the Ravaged Caravan; the Thunderhorn well, Seer Wiserunner and the Bael'dun
# digsite; the Galak centaurs and the Venture Co. mine); Red Rocks, the northern plains and the
# Wildmane well to Thunder Bluff (flight path; druids to Moonglade); the Windfury harpies, Ghost Howl,
# Arra'chea and the mine again back to Bloodhoof; Camp Taurajo and the Crossroads (flight paths);
# a wind rider to Thunder Bluff and back; Durotar (Drygulch Ravine) and Orgrimmar (flight path);
# the zeppelin to the tower outside Undercity, in Tirisfal Glades, where Silverpine Forest (13-15)
# starts. Shamans fly back to the Crossroads from Orgrimmar to finish their Call of Fire.
# Flight paths learned: Thunder Bluff, Camp Taurajo, the Crossroads, Orgrimmar.

guide Tauren Starter (1-13)
races 6
levels 1 13
next Silverpine Forest (13-15)

